    OWNS_Company_Car SOURCE KEY (src_id) REFERENCES Company (id) DESTINATION KEY (dst_vin) REFERENCES Car (vin) PROPERTIES (since) LABEL OWNS_Company_Car,
    OWNS_Person_Car SOURCE KEY (src_id) REFERENCES Person (id) DESTINATION KEY (dst_vin) REFERENCES Car (vin) PROPERTIES (since) LABEL OWNS_Person_Car
